.* TECHHELP: the task menu for technical support.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='TECHHELP'.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPMSG PNLGRP=QHMHCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=SIGNOFF PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKPRB PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='CMD CALL QCMD'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=TECHHELP HELP=HLPTECHHELP KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Technical Support Tasks
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI HELP=DSPMSG OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD DSPMSG MSGQ(*SYSOPR)'.Display messages for the system operator
:MENUI HELP=WRKPRB OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD WRKPRB'.Work with problems with the system
:MENUI HELP='TECHHELP/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU PTF'.Work with PTF(s)
:MENUI HELP='TECHHELP/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD ?STRCPYSCN'.Copy your screen on another display station
:MENUI HELP='TECHHELP/OPT13' OPTION=13 ACTION='CMD ENDCPYSCN'.Stop copying your screen
:MENUI HELP='TECHHELP/OPT20' OPTION=20 ACTION='CMD ?STRRMTSPT'.Connect to technical support
:MENUI HELP='TECHHELP/OPT21' OPTION=21 ACTION='CMD ENDRMTSPT'.Disconnect from technical support
:MENUI HELP=SIGNOFF OPTION=80 ACTION='CMD SIGNOFF'.Temporary sign-off
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPTECHHELP.Technical Support Tasks - Help
:P.Working with whoever supports this system: reporting problems, fixes and
sharing the screen.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter. F9 opens a command line, F3
leaves the menu and F12 returns to the one before it.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for where the cursor is.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F9=Command line
:PD.Shows a command line to run a command from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TECHHELP/OPT11'.Work with PTF(s)
:P.Option 11. Shows menu PTF&colon. Work with PTF(s).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TECHHELP/OPT12'.Copy your screen on another display station
:P.Option 12. Runs the STRCPYSCN command&colon. Copy your screen on
another display station.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TECHHELP/OPT13'.Stop copying your screen
:P.Option 13. Runs the ENDCPYSCN command&colon. Stop copying your
screen.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TECHHELP/OPT20'.Connect to technical support
:P.Option 20. Runs the STRRMTSPT command&colon. Connect to technical
support.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TECHHELP/OPT21'.Disconnect from technical support
:P.Option 21. Runs the ENDRMTSPT command&colon. Disconnect from
technical support.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
